    "detailed_description": "Batter Up is a rogue-lite arena shooter where you bounce a baseball around the map to kill the undead. The game features 3 biomes and a variety of enemies to battle through. With over 50+ items to choose from for your builds, you can create chaotic and downright overpowered synergies to mow through enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149150/extras/a9b1b5b92d57060bac74cab6eee45ada.poster.avif?t=1740375370\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149150/extras/a9b1b5b92d57060bac74cab6eee45ada.webm?t=1740375370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149150/extras/a9b1b5b92d57060bac74cab6eee45ada.mp4?t=1740375370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 unique upgrade items<br></li><li>3 biomes to collect unique items in<br></li><li>3 unique bosses to fight<br></li><li>Multiple map variations<br></li><li>30 minute runs<br></li><li>1-2 minute waves</li></ul>",
